/P 133 0 R
/E (The chilkhati buruj the layered defensive bastion is Rajgad's most sophisticated military innovation. Rather than a single tower, it is a system of tiers set progressively inward, each providing an independent firing platform and line of resistance. When the outer tier falls, the inner tier holds. On Sanjeevani Machi, triple-layered bastions rise over 25 metres with overlapping fields of fire. The same principle is expressed across all sections of the fort seventeen bastions on Suvela, nineteen on Sanjeevani, six major bastions on the Balekilla ensuring every metre of every approach falls under potential defensive fire from multiple positions simultaneously.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
