/Title (Further east stands the Paryatak Niwas or Visitors' Residence, a more recent structure built to accommodate trekkers and pilgrims. The north-facing rectangular building features a verandah entrance, a sloping gabled tin roof, and an interior divided into a square western room and a larger eastern hall.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1321 0 R
/Next 1310 0 R
>>
