<<
/Title (Local tradition holds that before Navaratri, the lake would dry up to reveal the divine ornaments and utensils of Padmavati Devi for use in the festival's rituals. This sacred tradition was broken when a devotee removed one of the utensils, after which the ornaments never reappeared, an event locals interpret as the Devi's curse.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1323 0 R
/Next 1316 0 R
>>
