1323 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Padmavati Talav is a sacred oval-shaped freshwater lake situated north of the Padmavati Temple, with a depth of 30 feet and intact containment walls. An arched entryway built as a continuation of the lake wall marks its entrance, though the tank currently suffers from significant silting. The waters are notably white in colour during the monsoon and winter months.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1326 0 R
/Next 1321 0 R
>>
endobj
